It is already eight o'clock.
We are all very tired after the game.
We pack our things.
I put my water bottle into my backpack.
"Do you want to come back next Thursday at half past five?" Lena asks.
I definitely want to come back.
"Yes, I like playing with you all!" I answer.
Timo laughs.
"Great, then we can win together again!" he says.
We say goodbye.
"See you next week, Maya!" the three call out.
I go to the reception desk.
The friendly staff member is standing there.
I give the racket back to him.
"Here is the racket, thank you very much," I say.
"Are you coming back next week?" he asks.
"Yes, definitely," I answer.
